    "description": "\u2605ABOUT THE GAME\u2605\r\nHave fun with this love test playing with your couple. You can learn how much you know each other and enjoy a really funny time. Are you twin souls? Do you have a special relationship? Do you really know your couple? Find it out with this test!\r\n\r\n\u2605LOVE\u2605\r\nAn ideal test to play with your couple, in your free times.\r\n\r\n\u2605FUN\u2605\r\nOver 100 questions to have fun answering with your couple.\r\n\r\n\u2605CHALLENGE\u2605\r\nDiscover how much you and your couple know each other and how big is your love with this amazing test.",
